{"id": "t027-002", "text": "Spoke to Hugo on the phone. His dad is finally retiring at the end of the month after thirty-one years at the depot, and the family are throwing him a surprise lunch the weekend after. Hugo's sister is organising it and wants everyone to bring a photo from his early days there. I should get a card that Hugo can pass on, and dig out that picture from the open day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thirty-one years at the depot", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card that Hugo can pass on", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "dig out that picture from the open day", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t027-004", "text": "Petra's leaving do is off. She's been asked to stay on until the new manager is hired, so probably early March now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay on", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the new manager is hired", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably early March", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t027-007", "text": "Need to pick up dry cleaning and post the parcel before Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up dry cleaning", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post the parcel", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t027-009", "text": "Wiremu had his final day at the school yesterday. Lots of tears apparently. Ask him how the send-off went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final day at the school", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how the send-off went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "send-off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t027-010", "text": "Asha and her partner are both starting new jobs the same week in January, which she said will be chaos with the kids. Her mum is coming to stay the week before to help out with the school runs, and her brother has offered to take the youngest on Wednesdays. Asha's new place is in the city centre, so she'll be leaving at seven most days.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new jobs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same week in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "r3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r5", "type": "RELATION", "text": "youngest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in the city centre", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "seven most days"}]}
{"id": "t027-014", "text": "Björn has a new puppy, a spaniel called Pepper. He's taking a week off work afterwards to settle her in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Björn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new puppy, a spaniel called Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t027-017", "text": "Rhys and Mei are moving to Bristol at the end of the summer because Mei's been offered a lectureship there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a lectureship", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t027-018", "text": "Theo has been struggling since the restructure. His boss keeps adding to his workload, two of his colleagues have already left, and he's not sleeping well. He says he's started looking at other jobs but feels too drained to apply. His girlfriend wants him to talk to HR. Check in with him sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "restructure", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "colleagues", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking at other jobs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "drained", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t027-020", "text": "Mai's interview at the studio was cancelled; they gave the role to someone internal. She's disappointed but already applying elsewhere.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gave the role to someone internal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "disappointed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying elsewhere", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t027-021", "text": "Kenji Nakamura from the old team is leaving for a startup. His leaving drinks are on the 14th, and he said the day after he's flying to Osaka for two weeks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji Nakamura", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the old team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving for a startup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Osaka", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t027-026", "text": "Lunch with Claire and Sophie. Claire is going back to work after maternity leave in early March, and Sophie is covering her role until then. Sophie isn't sure whether she'll stay on in the team afterwards or go back to finance.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after maternity leave", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "covering her role", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until then"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sure", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards"}]}
{"id": "t027-028", "text": "Tamar has a panel interview for the curator post on Monday and a presentation to prepare for the day before. Remind me to ask Tamar how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "panel interview for the curator post", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "presentation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Tamar how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t027-030", "text": "Kavya got it! She starts at the council sometime next month. Her husband Ravi is taking her out for dinner on Friday to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got it", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t027-033", "text": "Spoke to Ignacio's wife at the school gate. He's starting the new role on Monday and she says he's been up every night preparing slides for his first team meeting. They're also expecting their second in the summer, so the timing is a bit mad. She asked if I'd take him for a pint the Friday after to make him switch off.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first team meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pint", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday after", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t027-034", "text": "Jess is thinking about leaving teaching. She's got an application in for a policy job and hears sometime next week. I need to remember to ask her about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about leaving teaching", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "policy job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t027-036", "text": "Wiremu's son has a trial with the youth academy over the summer. Wiremu says he's beside himself with excitement.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trial with the youth academy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "beside himself with excitement", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t027-037", "text": "Asha said her boss is retiring at Christmas and she's been asked to apply for the role. She's not sure she wants it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sure she wants it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t027-044", "text": "Rhys had his exit interview today. He said it was uncomfortable but he's glad it's done. His last day is the following Friday, and the team are taking him out for curry that evening. Mei is coming too. After that he's got a month off before Bristol, which he plans to spend painting the new place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exit interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "glad it's done", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "curry", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "After that", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "month off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Bristol", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t027-048", "text": "Remind me to ring Kenji when he's back from Osaka to hear about the new job.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Kenji", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Osaka", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t027-050", "text": "Beatriz has applied for the charge nurse post. Interview sometime next week. She's been stressed about it all month because her manager, Dr Shah, is on the panel and they don't always get on. She's asked me to run through some practice questions with her on Sunday. I'm bringing pastries.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Beatriz", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "charge nurse post", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all month"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Shah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "don't always get on", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "practice questions", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t027-051", "text": "Chidi passed his probation. Relief all round.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "probation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t027-053", "text": "Long call with Sophie. Her dad has decided to retire early, which nobody saw coming, and her mum is not thrilled because she thought they'd agreed to wait until he turned sixty-five. Meanwhile her brother Hugo has just been offered a job in Edinburgh and is deciding over the weekend. Sophie thinks he'll take it. She said the whole family is meeting up for Sunday lunch the weekend after to talk everything through. I should check in with her after that.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retire early", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until he turned sixty-five"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a job in Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Sunday lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after that", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t027-054", "text": "Claire's first day back went fine. The baby, though, cried for an hour at nursery that morning, and she felt awful.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "an hour"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "awful", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t027-056", "text": "Groceries, bin day, and call the dentist about moving my appointment to sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bin day", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call the dentist about moving my appointment", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dentist"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t027-059", "text": "Ignacio's team lead role was put on hold because of the budget freeze, so the November start is off for now. He's taking it well, considering. HR told him it might be revisited early next year, but he's not holding his breath. His wife thinks he should start looking elsewhere.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put on hold", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "revisited", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not holding his breath", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t027-060", "text": "Met Irina's partner, Gintaras, for the first time. He works in logistics and is about to start a new contract in early March. Irina says he's a bit anxious about it because the last place let him go after three months. Remind me to ask him how the first week goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in logistics", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new contract", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after three months"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how the first week goes", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
